# vi redo (`.`) details: counts (stored for x and c, not for insertions),
# insertions with nothing typed (redo enters insert mode again), changes
# with nothing typed, replace mode with nothing typed, end of input inside
# a count.
tags: vi vi-redo
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
--- script
readline "> "

=== count-stored-for-x
tags: vi-delete numarg
keys: abcdefghijklmnop\e<pause>02x<pause>3.<pause>.<dump>\r

=== insert-count-not-repeated
tags: vi-insertion-mode numarg
keys: \e<pause>3ix\e<pause>.<dump>\r

=== count-reset-by-insert
tags: vi-insertion-mode numarg
keys: abcdefgh\e<pause>0x3.ix\e<pause>.<dump>\r

=== redo-empty-insert-enters-insert-mode
tags: vi-insertion-mode
keys: \e<pause>.R<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-empty-insert-with-count
tags: vi-insertion-mode numarg
keys: \e<pause>3.R<dumpfull>\e<pause>.<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-count-then-empty-append
tags: vi-append-mode numarg
keys: abcdefghij\e<pause>0x<pause>3.<pause>a\e<pause>.<dump>\r

=== redo-empty-replace-uses-older-text
tags: vi-replace
keys: abcdef\e<pause>0R\e<pause>l.X<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-empty-append
tags: vi-append-mode
keys: abcdef\e<pause>0a\e<pause>l.X<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-empty-append-eol
tags: vi-append-eol
keys: abcdef\e<pause>0A\e<pause>0.X<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-empty-change
tags: vi-change-to
keys: abc def\e<pause>0cw\e<pause>w.<dumpfull>\r

=== redo-count-before-c
tags: vi-change-to numarg
keys: a b c d e f\e<pause>02cwX\e<pause>w.<dump>\r

=== redo-motion-count-of-c
tags: vi-change-to numarg
keys: a b c d e f\e<pause>0c2wX\e<pause>w.<dump>\r

=== redo-replace-count-not-repeated
tags: vi-replace numarg
keys: abcdefgh\e<pause>02RX\e<pause>l.<dump>\r

=== redo-subst-count
tags: vi-subst numarg
keys: abcdefgh\e<pause>02sX\e<pause>l.<dump>\r

=== eof-after-count
tags: vi-arg-digit eof
keys: abc\e<pause>2

=== eof-after-two-digit-count
tags: vi-arg-digit eof
keys: abc\e<pause>23

=== emacs-eof-after-count
tags: digit-argument eof
--- inputrc
--- keys
abc\M-2

=== api-start-c-redo-mid-line
tags: rl_vi_start_inserting api
--- script
def s
rl_vi_start_inserting "c" 1 1
end
defun start s
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" start vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\e<pause>0l\C-xX\e<pause>l<dumpfull>.<dumpfull>\r

=== api-start-d-redo-no-motion
tags: rl_vi_start_inserting api
--- script
def s
rl_vi_start_inserting "d" 1 1
end
defun start s
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-x" start vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\e<pause>0\C-xX\e<pause><dumpfull>.<dumpfull>\r

